<title>NORWAY: NORDIC SKIING-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS MEDALS TABLE.</title>
<headline>NORDIC SKIING-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS MEDALS TABLE.</headline>
<dateline>TRONDHEIM, Norway 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medals table at the</p>
<p>Nordic skiing world championships after five days on Tuesday</p>
<p>(tabulated under gold, silver, bronze):</p>
<p> 1. Russia		   4	    2	    2</p>
<p> 2. Norway		   2	    2	    1</p>
<p> 3. Finland		  1	    1	    1</p>
<p> 4. Japan		    1	    1	    0</p>
<p> 5. Italy		    0	    2	    1</p>
<p> 6 equal. Austria	  0	    0	    1</p>
<p> 6 equal. Czech Republic 0	    0	    1</p>
<p> 6 equal. France	   0	    0	    1</p>
</text>
